ob filename text source be input ya

ob filename of ob of source to name filename source filename be filename do
ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do
ob name run root to name text workspace root be text do
ob name run id to name text run id be text do

ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
su name stem stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

ob name workspace root to name text run artifacts dir path be plus do
ob text "/artifacts/" to name run artifacts dir path be plus do
ob name run id to name run artifacts dir path be plus do

ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
ob name run artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "/hear\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

ob name run artifacts dir path to name text chapter path be plus do
ob text "/hear/" to name chapter path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name chapter path be plus do
ob text "_chapters.txt" to name chapter path be plus do

ob text "node command/wise_chip_series_to_chapters.mjs \"" to name text chapter cmd be text do
ob name source path to name chapter cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name chapter cmd be plus do
ob name chapter path to name chapter cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name chapter cmd be plus do

su name chapter stage ob name text chapter cmd be command do

ob name workspace root to name text produce dir path be plus do
ob text "/know/produce" to name produce dir path be plus do
ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

ob name produce dir path to name text chapter produce path be plus do
ob text "/" to name chapter produce path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name chapter produce path be plus do
ob text "_chapters.txt" to name chapter produce path be plus do

ob text "cp \"" to name text chapter copy cmd be text do
ob name chapter path to name chapter copy cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name chapter copy cmd be plus do
ob name chapter produce path to name chapter copy cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name chapter copy cmd be plus do
su name chapter copy stage ob name text chapter copy cmd be command do

su name output stage ob name chapter produce path be write do
